<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglovaal sees Nkomati mine study by June.</title>
<headline>Anglovaal sees Nkomati mine study by June.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglovaal Ltd said on Thursday a feasibility study into the main Nkomati nickel mine in eastern South Africa was due to be completed in June.  </p>
<p>In a statement with half-year results, Anglovaal said its Nkomati joint venture -- which seeks to mine nickel, copper, cobalt, and platinum group metals -- had progressed satisfactorily.</p>
<p>A small high grade portion of the ore body, the Massive Sulphide Body, is already being exploited.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
